# This is a placeholder for a sample Excel file
# The actual file would contain columns like:
# - status (with values like "true positive", "false positive")
# - Security Ticket (empty for new findings)
# - summary (ticket summary)
# - description (ticket description)
# - priority (Low, Medium, High, Critical)
# - assignee (username)
# - issue_type (Task, Bug, Story, Epic)

# Sample data structure:
# | status | Security Ticket | summary | description | priority | assignee | issue_type |
# |--------|----------------|---------|-------------|----------|----------|------------|
# | true positive | | SQL Injection in Login | Critical vulnerability found in login form... | High | john.doe | Bug |
# | false positive | | XSS Alert | False positive alert from scanner... | Medium | | Task |
# | true positive | | CSRF Vulnerability | CSRF token missing in form... | Critical | jane.smith | Bug |
# | true positive | | Weak Password Policy | Password policy allows weak passwords... | Medium | | Task | 